WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Start with a clear goal. What are you trying to make?

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Add the context. Describe the audience, constraints and purpose.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Shape a useful result: a draft, a checklist, or a small example.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Read, question and improve. Check assumptions before using the result.
